        <mxCell id="GwZDzvBw4KAlplTj4DPt-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" value="&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot; data-start=&quot;314&quot;&gt;Arithmetic:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;320&quot; data-start=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;\(i\)&amp;nbsp;= index of&amp;nbsp;observation&amp;nbsp;(e.g., \(i\) =1, 2, ..., \(n\)&amp;nbsp; for \(n\)&amp;nbsp;observations)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Where:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;618&quot; data-start=&quot;322&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;387&quot; data-start=&quot;322&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;387&quot; data-start=&quot;324&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;\(Y_i\) =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Actual (true) target value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;dependent variable)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot; data-start=&quot;388&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;439&quot; data-start=&quot;390&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;\(X_i\)&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;= Input feature (independent variable)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot; data-start=&quot;440&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot; data-start=&quot;442&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mn&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;\(\beta_0\)&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;=&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Intercept (Where the line crosses the Y-axis, where&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;\(X_i\) = 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;535&quot; data-start=&quot;481&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;535&quot; data-start=&quot;483&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mn&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;\(\beta_1\)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;= Slope/coefficient (How steep the line is/&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;tells us how much&amp;nbsp; \(Y_i\)&amp;nbsp;changes when&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;\(X_i\)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;increases by one unit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/mn&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;618&quot; data-start=&quot;536&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;618&quot; data-start=&quot;538&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-mathml&quot;&gt;&lt;math xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML&quot;&gt;&lt;mrow&gt;&lt;msub&gt;&lt;mi&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; text-align: center; text-transform: none;&quot;&gt;\(\epsilon_i\)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/mi&gt;&lt;/msub&gt;&lt;/mrow&gt;\varepsilon_i&lt;/math&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;msupsub&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-t vlist-t2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;vlist-s&quot;&gt;​ = E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-end=&quot;573&quot; data-start=&quot;559&quot;&gt;rror term&lt;/span&gt; (Residual)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;The goal is to find&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;\(\beta_0\)&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;\(\beta_1\)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;that minimize the error between predicted (&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;\(\hat y_i\)&lt;/span&gt;) and actual (&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;\(y_i\)&lt;/span&gt;) values&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul data-end=&quot;618&quot; data-start=&quot;322&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
